# integrity.py audit

- [ ] Does the receipt include every top-level `.py`, `.ref`, and `.ai-check` file?
- [ ] Are paths canonical, repo-relative, unique, and deterministically ordered?
- [ ] Are explicit extra files required to exist inside the repository root?
- [ ] Is the aggregate computed from exact per-file SHA-256 lines?
- [ ] Are runtime output, caches, and timestamps excluded from implementation identity?
